{"c":[{"name":"20261004T174001Z-e18f8b63a04bb172","text":"A17: paste-then-reconcile takes Caret's own changeCount from clearContents()'s return (writing items does not move it, GeneralPasteboardTests); a count read later can adopt a user's copy and overwrite it on restore.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T180747Z-a16b7748bab5e5ec","text":"A17: HID keys are VM-only and the VM has no Jev key, so A14's memory_fill_walk runs on the desktop with CARET_A14_TAB=hook (Tab via the host's debug socket); a hook Tab does not move the event tap's consumed counter.","type":"note"}]}
